<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Exam 39 - Ket qua</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; }
h1 { color: #C0392B; font-size: 20pt; }
h2 { color: #1F618D; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 24px; }
.qtext { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.opt { margin: 4px 0 4px 20px; }
.correct { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
.selectedwrong { color: red; font-weight: bold; }
.selectedright { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
.explain { background: #F4F6F6; padding: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-style: italic; }
img { max-width: 500px; margin: 10px 0; display:block; }
</style></head><body><h1>EXAM 39 - Ket qua &amp; giai thich</h1><p><b>Ho ten:</b> Hang Tran<br/><b>Ket qua:</b> 2/17 cau (11%)<br/><b>Thoi gian lam bai:</b> 00:08:12<br/><b>Ngay nop bai:</b> 2026-08-03 14:06:43</p><p><i>Luu y: Khong tim thay lien ket video giai thich nao tren trang ket qua cua bai thi nay.</i></p><hr/><h2>Cau hoi 1</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a cause of defects about fitness tracker system? i) Because he was unfamiliar with the domain of fitness training, the author of the assumed that users wanted heartbeat in beats per hour. ii) The tester of the smartphone interface had not been trained in state transition testing, so missed a major defect. iii) An incorrect configuration variable implemented for the GPS function could cause location problems during daylight saving times. iv) Because she had never worked on wearable devices before, the designer of the user interface misunderstood the effects of reflected sunlight</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. i [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. i,ii</div><div class="opt ">c. i,ii,iii</div><div class="opt correct">d. i,ii,iv [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 1.2.3 phần định nghĩa về error, defect, failure. Câu hỏi là cause of defects chính là error nên các đáp án nào chỉ về người làm sai thì là đáp án đúng, ở đây có I. he was unfamiliar, ii) The tester, iv) Because she had never worked đều là nói về con người làm sai</div><h2>Cau hoi 2</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is Not a factor affecting testing effort ?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. Functionality coverage [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. Test outcomes</div><div class="opt ">c. Characteristics of development process</div><div class="opt ">d. Characteristics of product</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 5.1.4 các nhân tố ko ảnh hưởng đến estimate theo sách thì là A</div><h2>Cau hoi 3</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following is a primary benefit of gathering and analyzing test coverage metrics?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. It helps to automate the selection of test data for complex scenarios. [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt correct">b. It provides an objective measurement of progress and product risk. [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">c. It guarantees that no critical defects remain in the code.</div><div class="opt ">d. It allows developers to fix code errors without requiring re-testing.</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> refer 5.3.1 nó hỏi về lợi ích của việc thu thập test coverage metric, xem cả công thức tính về coverage của chương 4 thì test coverage là đo về tiến độ</div><h2>Cau hoi 4</h2><div class="qtext">Which of the following tools is most useful for reporting test metrics or monitoring testing as a whole, rather than focusing on a specific area?</div><div class="opt selectedright">a. Test management tool [BAN DA CHON - DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">b. Static analysis tool</div><div class="opt ">c. Model-Based testing tool</div><div class="opt ">d. Coverage tool</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 6.1 tool để report metrics là gì?</div><h2>Cau hoi 5</h2><div class="qtext">You are a tester participating in a retrospective meeting, which of the following BEST describes a task that you should do?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. I should bring in topics that are related to testing only. All other topics will be covered by different participants [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. I participate in a retrospective meeting as an observer, ensuring that the meeting follows the retrospective rules and agile values</div><div class="opt correct">c. I should provide feedback and input on all activities conducted by the team during the sprint [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. I should only attend and participate in a retrospective meeting if I have any feedback and input related to activities conducted by the team during the sprint</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 2.1.5 Retrospective meeting là buổi họp rút kinh nghiệm và cải tiến quy trình nên mọi người đc tham gia vào thảo luận tự do và đóng góp ý kiến về tất cả các hoạt động của dự án</div><h2>Cau hoi 6</h2><div class="qtext">The term “burn down chart” refers to which of the following?</div><div class="opt selectedwrong">a. A chart showing which team members are working the most, and are likely to be under stress [BAN DA CHON - SAI]</div><div class="opt ">b. A chart showing the progress of each user story, and when they are likely to be completed</div><div class="opt correct">c. A chart showing the amount of work left to be done, versus the time allocated for the iteration [DAP AN DUNG]</div><div class="opt ">d. A chart showing defects that have been fixed, and when the remaining defects are likely to be fixed</div><div class="explain"><b>Loi giai:</b> Refer 1.4 test activities. burndown chart là biểu đồ theo dõi tiến độ công việc của cả dự án Agile nó ko nằm trong test report, nó quản lý cv của cả dự án, cho biết 2 đường là đường plan và đường remaining</div><h2>Cau hoi 7</h2><div class="qtext">An insurance application calculates premiums based on the applicant's age with the following rules: - Applicants below 1 year old receive the insurance for free. - Applicants below 18 years old (but at least 1 year old) are charged 
300.
